This critique is advisory only. It does not ratify an oracle, implement a
runner, mutate P2, accept or reject the redesign on CVF's behalf, activate
machine-first review, open P4, change downstream workspaces, or claim
runtime, provider/live, public-sync, deployment, or production readiness.
Every finding above must be independently re-verified and absorbed by CVF
through the packet's named absorption workflow before it changes SOT.

